[h1]EoE + Culture Expanded[/h1]

Compatibility patch for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3679840613]Embers of Empire - A Roman Restoration[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2829397295]Culture Expanded[/url].

[h2]A Living Roman World[/h2]

Rome may share an imperial dream, but its people are never all the same. This patch brings Culture Expanded together with EoE's Roman cultures and regional flavor, allowing both mods to keep the traditions and identities that make their worlds distinctive.

[hr][/hr]
[h2]Latest Update - Version 1.18.2[/h2]

[list]
[*]Updated Culture Expanded compatibility for the current EoE culture setup.
[*]Connected regional cultures such as Dalmatian, Pannonian Romance, and African Roman to their intended Roman roots.
[*]Preserved Culture Expanded traditions, appearance, and regional flavor alongside EoE.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*]Embers of Empire - A Roman Restoration
[*]Culture Expanded
[/list]

[h2]Load Order[/h2]

[list=1]
[*]Embers of Empire
[*]Culture Expanded
[*][b]EoE + Culture Expanded[/b]
[/list]

[b]Supported CK3 version:[/b] 1.19.0.6 "Scribe"

Start a new campaign after major culture updates. If traditions or regional cultures do not appear as expected, report your complete playset, load order, and CK3 version.
